# Files in /home/ewt/.config/forgejo-runner/ that DO NOT get tracked
# by yadm. Do not commit this file — it's documentation for the
# ~/.gitignore in the runner config dir.
#
# Why this template exists:
#   On the UM790 we ship modules/forgejo-runner/ from
#   dverdonschot/fedora-cosmic-atomic-ewt. The runner's runtime
#   config lives in ~/.config/forgejo-runner/ on the host (config.yaml,
#   env file, etc.). Those are per-host, often per-user, regenerated
#   by setup-forgejo-runner.sh. yadm should NEVER commit them.
#
# If you ever do want to track runner configs in yadm, put the actual
#   /home/ewt/.config/forgejo-runner/.gitignore at:
#     *
#     !.gitignore
#     !.gitignore-template
#   which mirrors this template's intent.

*
!.gitignore
!.gitignore-template
